# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your real Gemini key there.
# DO NOT put a real key in this file — `.env.example` IS CHECKED INTO GIT.
# `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` is the public template.
#
# ⚠ HACKATHON DEMO ONLY ⚠
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars ship in the client bundle. That's acceptable for a
# private demo build. In production these calls must be proxied through a
# backend so keys stay server-side.

# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Used for EVERYTHING:
#   - vision (services/gemini.js → extractDocument)
#   - audio transcription (services/whisper.js → transcribe)
#   - reasoning (services/claude.js → check-in / med safety / training / nutrition / brief)
# All routed through gemini-3-pro-preview.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_GEMINI_API_KEY=PASTE_YOUR_KEY_IN_DOT_ENV_NOT_HERE
